Puerts (the Unreal_v1.0.9 release's plugin folder) for UE 5.8 on a Mac:
- JsEnv uses V8 9.4.146.24 (puerts/backend-v8 V8_9.4.146.24, which has macOS arm64 libraries; unpack its
  v8_9.4.146.24 folder into ThirdParty/), linked statically in the editor too: the dylib build needs Chromium's
  libc++, which the release doesn't ship, so the plugin fails to load.
- the CSharpParamDefaultValueMetas UBT plugin builds on the engine's .NET, defines UE_5_5_OR_LATER, and drops a
  Microsoft.CSharp reference that .NET 10 reports as an error.
- UE 5.8 API changes: FLinearColor::QuantizeFloor, UField::Next as TObjectPtr, ProcessDelegate.
Apply from inside the Puerts folder: git apply --ignore-whitespace <this file>

